most useful for AI, you know, and so that is very differentiating that we have such a unique dataset coming into it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/19/planet-labs-pl-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PL 2027 Q1","e":"pl","d":"2026-06-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Marshall","x":"Last but not least, our investments in AI and position Planet at the forefront of the industry, making planetary scale, insights accessible and actionable to more users than ever before.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/planet-labs-pl-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PL 2027 Q1","e":"pl","d":"2026-06-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashley Whitfield Johnson","x":"…for fiscal year '27 adjusted EBITDA profit to be between breakeven and $10 million, reflecting our desire to drive EBITDA profitability on an annual basis even as we continue to invest in our Space Systems capabilities, AI-powered solutions and our global sales and marketing organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/05/planet-labs-pl-q1-2027-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PL 2027 Q2","e":"pl","d":"2026-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Marshall","x":"To highlight a few interesting use cases in the sector, last month, we signed a 6-figure expanded renewal with a hyperscaler AI developer for global monitoring of data centers and semiconductor manufacturing facility construction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/planet-labs-pl-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PL 2027 Q2","e":"pl","d":"2026-09-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Marshall","x":"We're currently seeing meaningful demand from our customers in the AI and financial services industries to use Planet's data to track the pace of infrastructure expansion across the AI value chain.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/planet-labs-pl-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PL 2027 Q2","e":"pl","d":"2026-09-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Marshall","x":"Yes, definitely a price increase opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/planet-labs-pl-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PL 2027 Q2","e":"pl","d":"2026-09-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William Marshall","x":"And that hasn't yet passed through Congress.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/09/planet-labs-pl-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"cinema":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"imax":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"streaming":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"dtc":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"ai_spend":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,3,3,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,7,6,1,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,2,2,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,4,4,0,7914,1764]],"tariffs":[[61,1,7247,1,0,1,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"pricing_power":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,2,2,0,7914,1764]],"cost_cuts":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0,0,0,7664,1348],[64,1,9462,0,0,0,7118,1560],[65,1,8697,0,0,0,7063,943],[66,1,10176,0,0,0,7914,1764]],"guidance":[[61,1,7247,0,0,0,5316,1021],[63,1,9885,0